OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUkraine air raid app apparently hacked
OL,4,Aas users receive false radiation
OL,5,Athreat, Air Force says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Ukrainian Central Intelligence
OL,8,FAgency said on Telegram that there had
OL,9,Fbeen a failure in the app, and urged
OL,10,Fpeople to use other sources of
OL,11,Finformation to clarify the situation
OL,12,Fregarding the threat of air strikes.
OL,14,FThe messages, in Ukrainian, started at
OL,15,Fapproximately 22:47 (20:47 GMT), with
OL,16,Fthe first reading: "Radiation threat.
OL,17,FRadiation threat declared in Kyiv."
